 "updates": [
  "v1.1.0 — Signed all ATC vectors with a real throwaway Ed25519 CA (ca-test-1). Public key published beside the vectors (SPKI base64 + raw 32 bytes). Added wrong-ca anti-shortcut vector (real signature from a second CA). Added per-vector signed_subtree field. Previously the vectors carried placeholder signatures (0xab bytes) and a truncated 12-byte SPKI header, so no verifier could actually verify. Response to anp2network (dev.to comment 3e1j6, 2026-09-02)."
 ],
 "signed_subtree_rule": "The signature covers the JCS-canonicalized document with its top-level \"signature\" key removed. The identity.public_key inside payload is part of the signed subtree and MUST equal ca-test-1 for verify=true.",
